# Enterprise AI Automation Engineering Platform

A **self-learning AI Automation Engineer** — not a script generator — for a Java
Selenium-Cucumber banking automation framework (SBI environment).

It learns the application by recording each unique transaction **once**, builds a
permanent knowledge repository from every recording and every execution, generates
and maintains Feature Files / Page Objects / Step Definitions / **pure-Java runners
(no Maven, no Gradle)**, executes real transactions end-to-end including the forced
password change and the CBS teller reset, and heals itself when the UI shifts.

> **Rule:** Python orchestrates. Java executes. The AI never replaces the Java
> framework — it reads it, indexes it, extends it and repairs it.

---

## 1. Quick start

### Prerequisites

| Need | Notes |
|---|---|
| Python 3.11+ | orchestration layer |
| SQLite (bundled with Python — no install needed) | knowledge repository + RAG |
| JDK (javac + java on PATH, or `JAVA_HOME` set) | compiles the framework |
| Microsoft Edge + msedgedriver | recording and execution |
| Selenium / Cucumber jars in `java-framework/lib/` | **exactly the jars from your office PC** |

### Install

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt

cp .env.example .env
python scripts/generate_key.py          # paste output into SECRETS_MASTER_KEY
# edit .env: SQLITE_PATH, AZURE_OPENAI_*, EDGE_DRIVER_PATH, CBS_SOCKET_*

python scripts/init_db.py               # creates the SQLite file, schema + seeds transaction 9750

python run.py                           # → http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

Copy your jars into `java-framework/lib/`, then:

```bash
cd java-framework && ./build.sh          # or build.bat on Windows
```

