## 4. When do I have to re-record?

| Change | Re-record? |
|---|---|
| Brand-new transaction | **Yes** |
| Application fully redesigned | **Yes** |
| AI confidence below threshold | **Yes** — the platform tells you, and why |
| Locator / CSS / attribute / position change | No — self-healed |
| Validation or message text change | No — self-healed |
| Small workflow tweak | No — self-healed |

