## 10. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Fix |
|---|---|
| `Database not ready` on startup | run `python scripts/init_db.py` (creates the SQLite file + schema) |
| AI generation/healing disabled | set `AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY` and `AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT` |
| `javac not found` | set `JAVA_HOME` in `.env` |
| `0 jars found` | copy your Selenium/Cucumber jars into `java-framework/lib/` |
| Execution blocked on credentials | Profile Manager → fill teller id/password + CBS reset string |
| `Transaction X is not in the knowledge repository` | record it once on the Record screen |
| `flagged for re-recording` | the report explains why; re-record that transaction |
| CBS reset `unreachable` | set `CBS_SOCKET_HOST` / `CBS_SOCKET_PORT`, check the probe on Execute |

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for how each spec section maps onto the code.
